1. Definitions

"Library" means OS Cobblemon Library, including its source code, official binary
releases, resources, documentation and associated files.

"Public API" means the documented public Java API exposed by packages under
com.ourstory.oscobblemon, excluding com.ourstory.oscobblemon.internal and any
other API explicitly documented as internal or unsupported.

"Independent Mod" means software developed separately from the Library that
uses the Public API without incorporating copied Library source code or a
modified version of the Library.

2. Limited API-use permission

Subject to this license, LevelsFR grants permission to:

- inspect the publicly available source code for reference, compatibility,
  debugging and integration purposes;
- develop Independent Mods that compile against and use the Public API;
- distribute Independent Mods in source or binary form, commercially or
  non-commercially;
- declare OS Cobblemon Library as a dependency and direct users to official
  distribution channels for the Library.

Use of the Public API does not require an Independent Mod to disclose, license
or publish its own source code.

