Except where required by applicable law or necessarily granted by the hosting
platform for repository viewing or forking, no permission is granted to:

- copy Library source code into another project;
- modify and redistribute the Library;
- publish or distribute unofficial, patched, forked or rebranded builds of the
  Library;
- redistribute the Library itself, in source or binary form, outside official
  distribution channels without prior written permission from LevelsFR;
- sublicense, sell or license the Library itself;
- remove or alter copyright, license, authorship or attribution notices;
- use the OS Cobblemon Library name, logo or LevelsFR identity in a way that
  implies endorsement, official status or authorship of a third-party project.

Independent compatibility layers, integrations and mods that only call the
Public API are permitted under Section 2.

4. Official binaries

Only binaries published by LevelsFR through official project distribution
channels are considered official builds.

Third-party projects may depend on those official binaries, but this license
does not grant permission to republish, mirror or replace them with modified
copies.

